@Harry-Chen since #52379 was closed in favor of the now-merged #53443, the blocker is resolved and the PR should be ready to move forward. 
The repository needed the opt-in Docker build path and test against CUDA 13.4 before the Marlin W4A8 PR could be merged which is what #53443 does. 
Could we move forward with the final review/merge?

